[[File:Borongi bolgarlar Gaziz cover.jpg|thumb|right|Tatar book written in the Arabic script.]]

'''Tatar literature''' ({{langx|tt-Cyrl|татар әдәбияты}}) consists of [[literature]] in the [[Tatar language]], a [[Turkic languages|Turkic language]] spoken in the [[Republic of Tatarstan]] in [[Russia]].  Tatar literature is a part of [[Tatar people|Tatar society]] and has been part of Tatar history since the existence of a Tatar state.{{Cn|date=April 2025}} Notable Tatar poets include [[Ğabdulla Tuqay]] and [[Näqi İsänbät]].

